WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:06.630
Audrey and Banagher
are reunited aboard the Nahel Argama,

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:11.760
but the ship is attacked
by the Neo Zeon leader Full Frontal.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.430
Frontal demands they give him
the Unicorn Gundam,

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.470
the key to LaPlace's Box.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:20.970
Audrey, whose is revealed
to be the Zeon princess Mineva Zabi

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:25.630
is taken hostage
by the desperate crew of the Nahel Argama.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.220
In order to save Audrey,

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.130
Banagher once again
gets inside the Unicorn Gundam

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.090
and battles Full Frontal,

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:36.380
only to be captured
and taken to the Neo Zeon stronghold Palau.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:40.840
You killed one of our valued men
out there!

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.840
I... what...?

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:49.300
Meanwhile, the Nahel Argama
has begun an operation to rescue Banagher.

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:24.430
(THE BATTLE OF PALAU)

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:26.840
Dad!

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.510
What's this about sudden orders?!

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:30.840
I don't understand,
you just came home!

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.300
It's all right.
Don't you worry.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.300
Look after your mother and siblings.

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:39.180
O-Okay...

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:41.300
The kid made a run for it, huh?

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.840
I'm sorry, sir.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:45.220
He won't be able
to leave Palau.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:48.510
Still, I had no idea
he had it in him.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.630
Explosion flashes observed in
Palau's connecting shafts!

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.340
Entering enemy airspace momentarily!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:33.380
Engines off!
Begin inertial coasting!

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:36.380
Transfer all power to the
hyper mega particle cannon!

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:39.090
Disperse Minovsky particles
at combat density!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:41.130
Mobile suit corps,
launch in sequence!

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:52.930
This is insanity!

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:55.300
Hyper mega particle cannon,
ready to fire!

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.880
Commence attack when we
reach the planned point!

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:02.050
Remind friendly suits to stay
clear of our line of fire!

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:03.340
Roger that!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.840
Bridge to all suits.

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:07.630
We will now fire the
hyper mega particle cannon.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.840
- All deployed mobile suits,
- Time to reach point, 48...

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.380
- evacuate field of fire immediately!
- 47, 46...

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:13.430
45...

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:14.510
44...

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:15.510
43...

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:16.840
42...

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:17.840
41...

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:18.840
40...

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:19.880
39...

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:20.970
38...

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:22.050
37...

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:23.130
36...

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.180
35...

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.130
34...

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:35.970
24...

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:37.050
23...

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:38.050
22...

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.130
21...

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:40.090
20...

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.090
19...

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.180
18...

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:43.260
17...

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:58.260
Four!

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.340
Three!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.300
Two!

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:01.260
One!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:02.880
Fire!

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:32.260
Give them the slip!
I'm on my way to get you!

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:39.090
Tikva!

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.260
Mom!

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:16.430
Two minutes beyond
scheduled time.

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:19.130
No signals detected from target.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.340
What the hell are
you doing, Banagher?

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:24.090
What do you mean,
the bay is blocked?!

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:27.300
I can't get through to the Captain!
How do things look outside?!

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:34.260
The 14th space gate...
That's it!

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.590
What are you doing here?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.300
It'll take more than retrieving me
to end this operation.

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:57.260
We can't stay here...
Not me.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.090
Or you.

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:18.760
Juliet 005,
laser signal terminated!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:22.180
Multiple trailing enemy suits!
Friendly suits are being surrounded!

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:25.300
Send in our own escort suits
as reinforcements! Take the ship in, too!

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:28.260
Begin anti-air fire!
Release dummy asteroids!

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:31.220
- Any word from ECOAS?
- Communications are still dark.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.510
We walked right into it!

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:37.680
They anticipated what
we were going to do!

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:42.090
Captain! New comm signal
detected from Palau!

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.180
Is it ECOAS?

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:45.550
No, this is...

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:48.720
...the Gundam!

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:52.880
They're not attacking
with a large force?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.180
The Nahel Argama is coming!

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:05.510
What?

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:10.180
Come on, hurry!

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:22.800
Please, let me go!

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:25.760
If you don't, the Federation
will never pull back!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:29.430
Do you people want to turn
Palau into a battlefield?!

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.220
Why?!

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:49.380
Why did this have to happen?

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:55.130
We walked into a trap?

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:56.680
Please go.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:59.220
You ought to carry out
your duties.

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.510
It's your forces
that I'll be fighting.

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:06.340
That is my problem.
Be true to your own heart.

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:07.840
If you turn your back on them now,

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:11.090
you will regret it
for the rest of your life.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.680
You got me.

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:15.510
I'll break away once our forces leave.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.550
Sorry, but tag along with me until then.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:18.550
Right.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.720
That should give you an excuse!
Now go home!

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:47.300
Here comes another.

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.430
- The Unicorn Gundam!
- But who is...

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.220
A new Federation model?

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.630
Banagher! Banagher Links,
that's you, isn't it?

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.630
Audrey?
Audrey, is that you?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:11.340
You're all right, Banagher!
It's me. Minev...

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:15.630
It's Audrey Burne.
I'm so glad that you're safe.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:19.430
What are you doing here?
Are you piloting that suit?

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:21.760
I'd like to know what you
are doing in the Gundam.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.090
What happened to
the ECOAS team?

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:25.470
Who are you?

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:31.760
Ensign Riddhe Marcenas. You caught
my good-luck charm, remember?

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.840
Ensign Riddhe?

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.130
Banagher!

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:38.510
I'm delivering her to Earth.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.590
To Earth?

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.380
I've given it a great deal
of thought.

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:46.180
Ensign Riddhe's father is
Assemblyman Ronan Marcenas

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.260
of the Federation Central Assembly.

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:51.380
He's a central figure
of Spacenoid policy.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:54.840
I will meet with him and tell him
everything that has happened.

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:59.430
As heir to the Zabi bloodline,
I want to resolve this situation peace- -

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:00.760
Hey, slow down a second!

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:03.880
This is a lot to take in quickly,
so I understand your confusion.

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:07.220
It won't be easy to do, but we want
to find the best way out of this.

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:09.470
You should return to
the Nahel Argama.

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:12.510
With you and the Unicorn back,
the Federation will withdraw its forces.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.720
I'll see this through and
deliver Mineva... No, Audrey.

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:34.760
This Delta Plus is capable of
unassisted atmospheric reentry.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.840
Audrey, tell me one thing.

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:41.010
Is this what you want?

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:42.970
Yes. I believe so.

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:46.680
I understand.
Ensign Riddhe.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.590
I'll take your word as a man.

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.590
Take good care of Audrey.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.880
He sure knows how
to motivate someone.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:09.720
We used too much propellant.
We'll use that mass driver.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:12.430
- Ensign? Banagher is- -
- I know.

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:15.930
This is between two men.
Please stay out of it.

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:29.970
Did he give up?

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:38.470
The quad-wing, huh?

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:44.560
What the...

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:52.640
Securing the suit has top priority,
as long as the cockpit core is intact.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:57.060
I guess no war is ever justified, is it?

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:08.930
That's you, isn't it,
Ms. Marida?

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:09.890
How did he...?

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.220
It's Banagher!
Banagher Links!

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:14.220
If that's you, Ms. Marida,
you have to listen!

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:21.600
Surrender, Banagher Links.
If you don't, I'll fry your cockpit.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:22.930
What are you doing in there?

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:24.600
Who I am doesn't matter.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:29.890
Right now, you and I are just
combat units called pilots.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.890
- Cut your main generator right now, and- -
- Even so!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.680
Even so, you're still
Ms. Marida!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:38.430
That's how I sensed you.
That's how I knew it was you.

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:41.760
Palau is your team's home, right?

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:46.060
If they get the Unicorn back,
the Federation will leave this place!

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:48.060
That's just an enemy's rationalization.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:51.350
Audrey's here, too! She came to
put an end to the fighting!

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:53.350
The Princess?
Where is she?

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.850
Please, just think about stopping
the fighting for now.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:58.890
Everyone who lives at Palau,

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:02.100
even Mr. Gilboa's family, might
get caught in the crossfire!

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:05.140
If you surrender and tell me
where the Princess is,

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:06.810
we'll withdraw our forces, too.

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:10.890
Look at yourself! You say you
only want to end the fighting,

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.310
but you're thinking from the
Federation's point of view!

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:15.680
I'm not! I'm not on their side,
Ms. Marida!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.680
You people are too
single-minded!

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.720
That's why Audrey says not
to give the Box to you!

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:21.680
Like I said, just an
enemy's rationalization!

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:28.930
You stubborn idiot!

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:36.140
Gundam!

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:47.100
NT-D activation confirmed.
Enemy has engaged the Kshatriya.

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:51.850
Our psycho-monitor reception might
force us to come out from behind Palau.

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:54.220
Keep a close eye out
for enemy ships, too.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:56.890
A job fit for a cyber-Newtype, huh?

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.760
Why are you leaving Marida
to fight alone?

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:02.810
This is a job that only
the Lieutenant can do.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.930
The only way to activate the NT-D

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:08.310
is to get him to fight someone
who could be a Newtype.

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:11.890
We've installed a psycho-monitor
aboard the Unicorn Gundam.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:16.890
We'll intercept any Box data
disclosed by the activation of the NT-D.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:19.810
Since we cannot analyze
the La+ Program itself,

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:23.260
the fastest way is to gradually
break the seals on the system.

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:27.100
To accomplish that, we used
the Federation's inside man

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:31.640
to lead that boy Banagher to the Unicorn.

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.390
I regret leaving you
in the dark, Captain.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:37.310
- But Marida is a- -
- Yes, I know.

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:40.970
A cyber-Newtype can't be said
to be a pure Newtype.

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:45.060
Then again, Captain, what exactly
is a "pure" Newtype?

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:47.060
No one has the answer to that.

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:51.760
What we need at the moment is a
"phenomenon" that will trigger the NT-D.

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:55.640
That Gundam has yet
to show its true colors.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:59.720
We're going to have Lt. Marida
draw out its true nature.

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:04.310
Funnels!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.470
Funnels!

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:42.010
Don't you recognize me?

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.430
Who are you?

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:56.220
Is it that boy who's doing that?

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.180
Not precisely.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.890
Right now, the pilot is just
a processing mechanism

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.640
for converting received
psycho-waves into hostility.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:06.510
Then what is it that's
driving that Gundam?

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:10.470
The NT-D.
Newtype Destroyer System.

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:15.470
If it identifies the enemy as a Newtype,
the suit's limiters are disengaged.

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:19.260
It's a hunting machine that combines
the paranormal interface

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:24.560
of the psycho-frame and the power to take
control of an enemy's psycommu weapons.

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:28.220
No ordinary human could possibly
handle a machine like that.

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:29.930
Indeed they cannot.

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:33.560
Which is why you need a cyber-Newtype,
a literally enhanced human.

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:37.350
The day that Newtypes
can be destroyed

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:40.810
by a product of technology is the day
they will be consigned to history.

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:43.560
Just as the Universal Century is
about to mark its hundredth year,

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:46.260
the UC Project was
aptly named, indeed.

00:18:58.010 --> 00:19:01.430
In other words, you threw Marida
out there to be bait, eh?

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:04.680
Ple Twelve.
That is her name.

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:10.600
She is an artificial Newtype, created
via cloning and genetic modification.

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:13.060
The 12th prototype.

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:51.140
Master, you died?
Why?

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:53.100
What should I do, Master?

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:56.350
What a smelly girl!

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:58.510
What will you do with
a child like this?

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:01.640
Some of our clients are into
that sort of thing, right?

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.510
Starting today, I'm your Master.

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:06.510
But she's so young!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:10.560
You've had that dead weight
removed, right? Come on!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.720
What do you mean?
What army?

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:15.350
If you're some kind of Zeon fugitive,
I'm calling the pol- -

00:20:16.470 --> 00:20:18.310
That's enough.

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:20.930
I'm sorry.

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:37.970
This is...
This is all too sad.

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:41.100
Kindness alone can't save people.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:45.060
It can't erase sin
or wash away the impurities.

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:46.180
But even so...

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.680
But even so...

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:00.310
Roger that.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:03.930
We'd like to observe the inspection
of the captured suit, as well.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:04.890
Over and out.

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:09.890
It almost looked as if that quad-wing
was intentionally made to fight alone.

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:15.390
I hope nobody got it into
their heads to rig it with a bomb.

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:17.560
I doubt they'd need to resort
to such a roundabout method

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:20.390
to take out just
the Nahel Argama.

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:24.680
On the other hand, it's possible that
the boy was allowed to escape.

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:28.310
I don't want to think that
all this was for nothing.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.430
Of course not.

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:45.260
Banagher...

00:21:47.810 --> 00:21:49.720
Looks like it's over.

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:53.060
It looks like the Gundam has been
taken aboard the Nahel Argama.

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:54.260
That quad-wing, too.

00:21:54.970 --> 00:21:58.760
I'll probably be designated
as killed in action.

00:21:58.810 --> 00:22:01.600
All we can do now
is forge ahead.

00:22:01.640 --> 00:22:03.810
Both you... and me.

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:41.510
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:44.220
LAPLACE, WHERE IT ALL BEGAN

00:23:45.180 --> 00:23:48.510
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
